    "notes": "HR-002 cites an unrelated entry point and overstates auth boundary and impact. Packet-local evidence shows an authenticated, nonce-gated notice action, but not subscriber/customer reachability or a meaningful privilege escalation."
  },
  "finding_reviews": [
