      "required_changes": [
        "Retract the Broken Access Control classification for HR-001.",
        "Do not recommend login or capability checks as the primary fix; `src/Integrations/OptInMonster/OptInMonsterIntegration.php:240-246` shows the route is intentionally exposed to anonymous frontend users.",
        "If the surface is retained for later discussion, downgrade it to a non-security abuse or consent risk note and mark `patchstack_eligible` false unless new evidence shows a bypass of a stronger intended control."
      ],
      "counter_evidence": [
